                <pb facs="0632" n="622" sameAs="frus:frus1941v06/pg622"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following error has been identified in <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations of the United States Diplomatic Papers</hi>, 1941, The American
                    Republics, Volume VI. Please be aware that printed volumes have not been
                    revised.</p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. Footnote 1, <ref target="#d125">Document 125</ref>,
                            Page 106 (date of errata entry: December 1, 2021)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The President of Panama was incorrectly identified in the footnote.
                        Ricardo Adolfo de la Guardia became President of Panama following a coup on
                        October 9, 1941.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
